<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>This download is NOT verified yet: Foxit publishes no hash for the file, and a check of the signature is not built, so nothing proves that the file is what Foxit published. The shared importer therefore refuses a real run of the cimian recipe unless the override sets pcman_allow_unverified to true. Downloads the current Foxit PDF Reader for Windows (the multi-language EXE installer, 64-bit). The address is found by FoxitInfoProvider (in this folder), which reads the Location header of the first two answers of Foxit's download address and follows no redirect; the third answer, a signed short-lived address, is followed by the downloader. The file is stored under a name made of the release folder's version. The version label is then read from the file itself by the shared WindowsExeVersion step; the version in the address is shown beside it (on 2026-10-02 the file's own version was 2026.2.1.39815 and the address's was 2026.2.1, its first three parts; that the next release keeps this is NOT established). The recipe never stops on an unchanged download, so a failed import is tried again at the next run. The three answers were read from Foxit's servers on 2026-10-02 and the recipe was NOT run with AutoPkg.</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.FoxitReader-Win</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>FoxitReader</string>
            <key>FOXIT_PRODUCT</key>
            <string>Foxit-Reader</string>
            <key>FOXIT_LANGUAGE</key>
            <string>L10N</string>
            <key>FOXIT_PACKAGE_TYPE</key>
            <string>exe</string>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>FoxitInfoProvider</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>foxit_product</key>
                    <string>%FOXIT_PRODUCT%</string>
                    <key>foxit_language</key>
                    <string>%FOXIT_LANGUAGE%</string>
                    <key>foxit_package_type</key>
                    <string>%FOXIT_PACKAGE_TYPE%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>URLDownloader</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>filename</key>
                    <string>FoxitPDFReader-%foxit_address_version%-%foxit_language%-x64.exe</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>EndOfCheckPhase</string>
            </dict>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.SharedProcessors/WindowsExeVersion</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
